      "writtenOn": "2015-12-17T15:07:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is more than just a copy.  We start with the initial set of roles in the role_to_check list.  As each is checked, it is removed.  However, Since one role implies another, those new roles have to be checked and they are added to this list, if they have never ben seen before.\n\nI have not heard that copy is more or less efficient than creating a new list, but this manner ensures that what we have is a list, regardless of the collection that was passed in.",
